WEBVTT

01:52.900 --> 01:55.900
Father keeps saying
the gods will protect us

01:56.000 --> 02:00.000
It's all a lie.
Why are we so poor?

02:00.800 --> 02:03.400
Where are all the gods and deities?

02:06.400 --> 02:11.120
Little Monkey, rest assured
I will not let anybody feed on you

02:11.800 --> 02:15.120
I'll take you to the woods.
Father has no way of finding us

03:10.400 --> 03:14.160
-Why did you bang into me?
-I didn't. He pushed me!

03:14.400 --> 03:16.400
Thanks to you, I tripped

03:16.400 --> 03:19.000
Are you deities?

03:19.400 --> 03:23.400
Little girl, don't tell me
you never noticed it

03:23.400 --> 03:27.120
The character "fu"(fortune/happiness)
is shown on every household's door

03:27.400 --> 03:29.160
The imperial family ask for it

03:29.160 --> 03:30.200
Officials pray for it

03:30.200 --> 03:32.120
Common folks welcome it

03:32.120 --> 03:34.160
Beggars dream of it

03:34.400 --> 03:38.000
Both mortals and immortals
wish to have fortune and happiness

03:38.000 --> 03:40.160
Who do they make offerings to?

03:40.160 --> 03:43.000
Me, the Fortune Star,
who delivers fortune and happiness

03:43.000 --> 03:46.000
Come on, what's great about you?

03:46.400 --> 03:49.160
Little girl,
let me tell you who I am

03:49.160 --> 03:52.400
I'm the reincarnation of
the Constellation of Letters and Songs,

03:52.400 --> 03:56.120
overseeing mortals'
official positions and riches

03:56.120 --> 04:01.160
Any man of learning
would worship me like a god

04:01.160 --> 04:05.000
Don't you listen to their bragging

04:05.000 --> 04:09.120
They aren't the least
what they claim to be

04:10.000 --> 04:16.400
I am the Longevity Star, most closely
related to your well-being

04:17.000 --> 04:19.400
I decide how long you'll live

04:20.120 --> 04:23.000
I used to be the elderly
South Pole

04:23.000 --> 04:27.160
Emperor of Jade assigned me
to take charge of mortals' life-span

04:27.160 --> 04:30.400
Hence, I'm given the name
Longevity Star

04:31.120 --> 04:36.000
As I'm in high spirits,
I will grant you a life of 300 years!

04:36.400 --> 04:38.120
Thank you very much

04:39.160 --> 04:40.400
Please rise

04:40.800 --> 04:45.400
Dear deities, I'd like to make
another wish if I'm granted one

04:49.000 --> 04:52.000
You're worried about your monkey,
right?

04:53.000 --> 04:54.400
Show me your hands

05:01.400 --> 05:05.400
Take the gold flakes as my payment
for buying your money

05:05.400 --> 05:10.000
Take them with you and your life
will be well taken care of

05:14.400 --> 05:16.400
Where will the monkey go to?

05:16.400 --> 05:23.000
We will take him to Heaven
and make him a deity. Like it?

05:23.400 --> 05:25.800
Little girl,
I will give you this jade

05:25.800 --> 05:31.400
I hope you'll be like it - blessed
with fortune, prosperity and longevity

05:32.160 --> 05:33.400
Thank you very much

05:33.400 --> 05:35.120
Goodbye...

05:40.160 --> 05:41.400
I'm not being naggy

05:41.400 --> 05:45.400
But you bought a monkey of all things.
What shall we do with it?

05:47.400 --> 05:51.400
We can give it
to Heavenly Queen Mother as a gift

05:53.400 --> 05:55.120
Abracadabra!

05:57.400 --> 06:01.160
-Isn't it lovely?
-Very

06:02.120 --> 06:05.160
I'm sure Queen Mother
will be thrilled by it

06:05.160 --> 06:09.120
I will make it well versed in
18 forms of martial arts

06:09.120 --> 06:10.800
I will make it talk too

06:15.400 --> 06:18.000
I will give you the power
to metamorphose

06:18.000 --> 06:21.400
You'll transform into
any figure you like

06:30.400 --> 06:34.400
May I wish Queen Mother
happiness and longevity!

06:35.400 --> 06:38.000
He's speaking, isn't he?

06:47.800 --> 06:49.800
Does he look like me?

06:49.800 --> 06:51.400
Only the head does!

06:53.200 --> 06:56.000
This is great fun.
I want to keep him!

07:20.400 --> 07:22.160
Wow, such fragrance!

07:22.160 --> 07:25.000
I thank Heaven for giving me
fine wine

07:35.400 --> 07:37.400
Let me have a couple of sips

07:42.400 --> 07:43.800
That's enough!

07:53.400 --> 07:55.160
Hey, it's not for you!

07:56.800 --> 07:59.400
Why didn't you ask me
before you drank it?

07:59.400 --> 08:04.400
Don't ever be angry, Ma-gu.
Do look at it from a different angle

08:04.400 --> 08:10.000
You should know that the three of us
are particularly fussy about wine

08:10.000 --> 08:13.120
You should feel honoured
that we think so highly of your wine

08:13.120 --> 08:16.400
Won't you feel better
if you look at it from this angle?

08:16.400 --> 08:19.120
Are you saying
I should shed tears of gratitude?

08:19.120 --> 08:22.200
Shall I present you with a plaque
thanking you for the eulogy?

08:22.200 --> 08:25.000
We'll gladly accept it
if you do so

08:25.000 --> 08:29.000
Fine, I'll have "Shameless Men"
inscribed on it

08:29.400 --> 08:34.160
-Oh my, someone's losing her temper
-I'll beat you to boot!

08:34.160 --> 08:37.400
I brewed this wine for Queen Mother's
birthday, mind you!

08:54.400 --> 09:01.000
Why? Why am I still waiting to be
invited to Queen Mother's birthday?

09:02.400 --> 09:04.400
I'm one of the deities too

09:05.400 --> 09:11.400
Am I to suppose that being Deity of
Plague, I'm destined to be inferior?

09:13.160 --> 09:16.000
I'm not convinced.
I can't stomach it!

09:30.400 --> 09:34.400
Nian, those deities
think nothing of us

09:35.400 --> 09:39.400
We must do great things
in the three realms

09:40.160 --> 09:43.400
You and I must achieve
the greatest in our own ways

10:19.120 --> 10:21.120
Stop there!
Stop there...!

10:22.400 --> 10:24.400
The Gate of Southern Heaven

10:24.400 --> 10:28.400
Oh gosh!
Look at the smoke over there!

10:29.120 --> 10:30.400
What's going on?

10:30.400 --> 10:32.400
A disaster has struck the mortal world

10:32.400 --> 10:34.400
Stop deceiving me.
I won't be duped

10:34.400 --> 10:38.400
Indeed demons have brought disasters
to the mortal world. Let's go!

10:40.400 --> 10:43.160
You can only go after
Queen Mother's birthday banquet

10:43.160 --> 10:45.160
It'd have been too late!

10:47.400 --> 10:48.800
Move aside!

10:56.120 --> 10:57.120
Ma-gu!

10:58.400 --> 11:01.000
Wait for me.
I have something to tell you

11:04.400 --> 11:08.000
Why? Someone's got under your skin?
Who is it?

11:08.000 --> 11:11.160
Who else but the three stars.
They played tricks on me!

11:11.160 --> 11:18.000
Everybody knows the constant quarrels
and alignment going on among you

11:18.000 --> 11:19.400
Nobody can help you

11:20.000 --> 11:23.120
But they really overdid it
this time round. They drank...

11:25.160 --> 11:27.400
Isn't this the Lingzhi wine you made?

11:28.000 --> 11:33.000
How can you possibly drink up the wine
the way the 3 stars did?!

11:34.160 --> 11:36.400
You should've told me
I had their saliva!

12:35.400 --> 12:38.000
Help!
Help...!

13:52.400 --> 13:55.400
The harder you try,
the more you'll suffer

13:55.400 --> 13:59.160
You'd better stay there and repent!

14:28.160 --> 14:33.000
Ma-gu's wine has always been THE brew
in any palatial banquet

14:33.000 --> 14:36.120
It's different every year.
It's always better

14:36.120 --> 14:41.400
Ma-gu, let me have the privilege
of trying some

14:46.160 --> 14:50.000
-It's excellent, but...
-It's a little bland

14:50.400 --> 14:54.000
But that gives it a special feel

14:54.400 --> 14:58.400
It tastes a little dry

14:59.160 --> 15:02.000
Your Majesty,
that's my new experiment

15:02.400 --> 15:05.400
Is that so?
That explains

15:06.400 --> 15:09.400
-Your Majesty, you don't like it?
-It's acceptable

15:36.400 --> 15:39.160
So he's afraid of fire crackers!

15:39.160 --> 15:41.400
In that case, give him more!

16:22.400 --> 16:23.400
Excellent!

16:25.000 --> 16:26.040
Excellent!

16:26.400 --> 16:31.000
The three stars have done good turns
in the mortal world

16:31.000 --> 16:35.400
Indeed. It wasn't easy
having to subdue that beast, Nian

16:35.400 --> 16:40.400
Why don't we choose a date
by way of celebration?

16:42.400 --> 16:46.000
Her Majesty's suggestion
can't be better!

16:46.000 --> 16:51.400
Didn't Her Majesty suggest we should
set a date to celebrate the triumph?

16:51.400 --> 16:57.400
I thought we could name the date
to be Nian

16:57.400 --> 17:05.160
Let everybody celebrate the date
which ushers in New Year

17:05.400 --> 17:08.400
While we're hailing the defeat
of the beast, Nian,

17:08.400 --> 17:12.400
we'd celebrate the return of spring
and prosperity at the same time

17:13.000 --> 17:16.120
It's a good idea.
The name is well-chosen

17:16.120 --> 17:20.800
The mortals will have another date
for festive celebration

17:20.800 --> 17:22.400
I thank Your Majesty
for the compliment

17:22.400 --> 17:26.400
It's the watch
when spring is ushered in

17:26.400 --> 17:28.400
Let's name it Spring Festival

17:28.400 --> 17:31.160
The 1st day of the 1st lunar month
is a red-letter day

17:31.160 --> 17:34.120
Both the mortal and immortal worlds
will mark the date in celebration

17:34.120 --> 17:37.120
Wise are Your Majesties!

17:40.400 --> 17:45.160
On the 15th day of every month in
every year, the three stars will...

17:45.160 --> 17:49.400
initiate an inspection tour and bless
the mortals with fortune and happiness

17:49.400 --> 17:54.000
They will in turn accept the mortals'
offerings as a show of goodwill

17:54.400 --> 17:56.120
Thank you, Your Majesty

17:59.400 --> 18:01.400
Our respects to Your Majesty!

18:02.400 --> 18:07.400
I'm giving the three of you
a piece of my mind

18:11.400 --> 18:15.120
Staying away from the birthday banquet
- that's your first misdemeanour

18:15.120 --> 18:20.120
To think you didn't even wish me on my
birthday upon arriving at Lingxiao -

18:20.120 --> 18:21.400
that's the second

18:21.800 --> 18:24.400
The banquet is over
and the crowd has dispersed

18:24.400 --> 18:28.400
But you carry on smiling away
without presenting your gifts -

18:28.400 --> 18:30.120
that's the third!

18:30.800 --> 18:34.120
I reckon you've got us wrong

18:34.400 --> 18:38.120
Tell me in what way
I've wronged you

18:38.120 --> 18:43.400
Nian was running amuck when Your Majesty
was celebrating your birthday

18:43.400 --> 18:47.400
We chose to tame the beast and
did good turns for Your Majesty...

18:47.400 --> 18:50.120
at the risk of being wronged

18:50.120 --> 18:53.000
That's the first show
of our respect for Your Majesty

18:53.000 --> 18:56.400
The rule dictates that we're required
to report to His Majesty...

18:56.400 --> 18:59.000
after we've subdued the beast

18:59.000 --> 19:03.560
If we chose to extend our birthday
greetings to Your Majesty first,

19:03.560 --> 19:08.400
it would be a serious matter if Your
Majesty is made a target of slander

19:08.400 --> 19:12.400
We decided to do what we did
on account of Your Majesty's reputation

19:12.400 --> 19:14.800
That's the second show
of our respect

19:15.800 --> 19:22.400
That's right. Why don't I show
Your Majesty what we've written?

19:23.000 --> 19:24.400
May you be blessed
with happiness and prosperity;

19:24.400 --> 19:26.120
may you be blessed with longevity

19:26.120 --> 19:31.000
Even if the three of us
are not with Your Majesty,

19:31.000 --> 19:36.160
Your Majesty will continue to bask
in fortune, prosperity and longevity

19:36.160 --> 19:38.400
That's the third show
of our respect

19:38.400 --> 19:41.000
Glib tongues are
what the three of you have!

19:41.000 --> 19:45.400
That explains why Ma-gu's wine
was cheated of and cleaned up!

19:46.400 --> 19:48.400
She told on us!

19:50.000 --> 19:53.400
Ma-gu is not to blame.
I found it out myself

19:54.000 --> 19:57.400
The three of you did a good job
in subduing Nian

19:57.400 --> 20:01.400
The mortals are building
Three Star Temple to worship you

20:12.400 --> 20:15.000
We thank Your Majesty
for your kind gesture!

20:26.800 --> 20:28.400
Let's go over there

20:35.400 --> 20:38.400
Look, someone's releasing
tortoises from captivity

20:39.400 --> 20:44.000
-I will grant you a life of 300 years
-Hang on...

20:45.160 --> 20:48.400
Are you granting it to the do-gooder
or the tortoises?

20:49.400 --> 20:51.000
I just feel so happy today

20:54.400 --> 20:56.120
Shishi and Feifei!

20:59.160 --> 21:01.000
Our respects to Your Eminences!

21:01.400 --> 21:05.400
There are so many devotees today.
It must've been hard on you

21:05.400 --> 21:09.120
Please do not say that.
That's part of our job

21:09.120 --> 21:11.400
No, it isn't hard at all!

21:11.400 --> 21:16.400
You must do a good job
of fact-finding for us...

21:16.400 --> 21:20.400
and deliver the people
from hardship and misery

21:42.400 --> 21:44.000
Celestial Order of Ranking

21:53.120 --> 21:56.400
They've even edged out
the Jade Emperor. Oh no!

22:19.800 --> 22:27.400
Your Majesty, don't you think
the ranking is rather improper?

22:30.160 --> 22:36.120
But at least Your Majesty has
only slipped from the 2nd to the 5th

22:36.400 --> 22:42.160
I've been trying to squeeze into
the top ten but have always failed

22:42.160 --> 22:45.400
Zhang Guolao,
why should you feel so upset?

22:45.400 --> 22:48.400
They are but vanity.
You shouldn't take it to heart

22:48.400 --> 22:51.000
Your Majesty, there is more to it

22:51.000 --> 22:56.000
Fortune, Prosperity and Longevity have
become the mortals' most popular deities

22:56.400 --> 22:59.400
Their popularity has even surpassed
Your Majesties'

22:59.400 --> 23:05.120
They present themselves to be the only
revered figures among the mortals

23:05.120 --> 23:08.400
I'm afraid even the three worlds
will have problem containing them

23:08.400 --> 23:12.000
If that's true,
indeed they've crossed the line

23:12.000 --> 23:15.160
Your Majesty, the mortals
are made of muddled souls

23:15.400 --> 23:22.000
I think they created the aura
to play up to the three stars

23:22.000 --> 23:25.400
I agree. I'm sure the idea
didn't come from the three stars

23:25.400 --> 23:27.400
I think something is amiss

23:27.400 --> 23:31.160
I suggest the three stars be recalled
for further questioning

23:31.160 --> 23:33.800
Fine.
Send for them!

23:39.800 --> 23:44.000
I know it's great suffering.
But please put up with it

23:45.400 --> 23:48.400
I will do my best to get you out

24:07.400 --> 24:11.000
How come you're still here?
I've been looking for all of you

24:11.000 --> 24:14.400
Please take it easy.
Anxiety will give you wrinkles

24:14.400 --> 24:16.160
I'm not in the mood for jokes

24:16.160 --> 24:18.800
God of Wealth and God of Kitchen
have complained to the Jade Emperor...

24:18.800 --> 24:20.160
about the ranking

24:20.160 --> 24:23.400
So what? There was no violation
against any celestial rules

24:23.400 --> 24:26.120
The gossip you've created
may not add up to much

24:26.120 --> 24:27.800
But it's an issue
if the bigwigs are perturbed

24:27.800 --> 24:31.400
Both God of Wealth and God of Kitchen
would say anything to undermine us

24:31.400 --> 24:34.000
Why should we bother
what they're saying?

24:34.000 --> 24:36.400
Yes, they're out
to pit themselves against us

24:36.400 --> 24:40.000
Jade Emperor wants you
to explain everything to him

24:40.000 --> 24:43.000
We've done nothing wrong.
Why should we fear?

24:45.400 --> 24:50.000
Your Eminences, please let our
daughter come back in one piece

24:50.000 --> 24:53.120
May she be blessed.
May she ride out the danger

24:53.120 --> 24:57.400
-What's happened to Xiaoniu?
-God of Plague has taken her away

24:57.400 --> 24:59.400
That must be a revenge
he exacted on us

24:59.400 --> 25:02.000
Yes, he might've freed Nian too!

25:02.000 --> 25:06.120
Do you still want to bother yourselves
with the mortals' trivia?

25:06.120 --> 25:10.400
It's no longer trivial if God of Plague
starts pitting himself against us

25:10.400 --> 25:16.120
We three buddies will go separate ways.
I will explain to the Jade Emperor

25:16.120 --> 25:18.400
Yes, you're more eloquent

25:18.400 --> 25:20.400
I'll see how Nian's getting on

25:20.400 --> 25:23.400
It's settled.
I will get Xiaoniu freed

25:23.400 --> 25:26.400
-Are you sure it'll work?
-It will!

25:34.400 --> 25:36.120
Father, help...!

25:39.400 --> 25:41.400
You'd better know how to behave!

25:42.160 --> 25:50.400
You'll have done your job if the three
stars come forth to save you. Or...

25:56.400 --> 25:59.000
Father, help me!

25:59.400 --> 26:00.400
Help...!

26:02.000 --> 26:04.400
Help! I'm here!

26:16.400 --> 26:20.400
So it's the Longevity Star.
Pardon me for not receiving you

26:21.000 --> 26:22.800
Cut the crap.
Let Xiaoniu off!

26:22.800 --> 26:25.400
I just want you
to have Nian freed

26:27.000 --> 26:29.200
I can accede to any other request
but this one

26:29.200 --> 26:32.120
In that case,
I will have to exact revenge!

26:43.000 --> 26:44.120
Ma-gu

26:52.400 --> 26:56.120
Prosperity, you can't go.
Jade Emperor wants to see you

26:56.800 --> 26:59.400
I hope Prosperity
will bear with the patience

27:04.400 --> 27:09.120
I tell you I'm very impatient.
Stop forcing it on me!

27:09.400 --> 27:13.400
Prosperity, I dare you
to do any harm to me!

27:25.400 --> 27:26.600
Come with me!

27:31.400 --> 27:32.400
Let's go

27:38.000 --> 27:41.400
Thank goodness
the seal is still there

27:47.400 --> 27:49.400
I know you're suffering

27:50.120 --> 27:56.400
But I can't let you off unless you
swear you'll stop harming the mortals

27:56.400 --> 28:00.400
I will plead with the Jade Emperor
to be more generous to you

28:08.400 --> 28:13.000
That's like your master
through and through - a rascal!

28:22.400 --> 28:24.400
Longevity is in trouble?

29:28.400 --> 29:29.800
Just you wait!

29:35.400 --> 29:37.000
You can go nowhere!

29:39.400 --> 29:41.800
You can never run away!

29:41.800 --> 29:44.400
Dark clouds and whirlwind!

30:14.160 --> 30:16.160
Thunder and lightning!

30:40.400 --> 30:43.000
Hail and storm!

31:08.800 --> 31:10.120
Three stars...!

31:15.800 --> 31:18.400
That's enough. Jade Emperor
is still waiting for us

31:19.400 --> 31:22.400
There'll never be peace
if God of Plague isn't exterminated

31:22.400 --> 31:27.400
Take away the frown.
Worry not as long as I'm around

31:27.400 --> 31:31.400
We'd better go or we'll have a hard time
explaining to the Jade Emperor

31:31.400 --> 31:33.000
Let's go

31:33.000 --> 31:35.400
Let's get Xiaoniu freed
before going back to Heaven

31:35.800 --> 31:39.400
You trio, you must be enjoying
all the fame and adulation!

31:39.800 --> 31:46.400
All the spirits and deities,
constellations and stars...

31:46.400 --> 31:49.400
are all being edged out!

31:49.400 --> 31:54.000
I hereby lodge a protest
on behalf of all the gods and deities

31:54.000 --> 31:57.000
Don't ever think that by occupying
the first three positions,

31:57.400 --> 32:00.800
you can brush us aside
and have no regard for us at all

32:00.800 --> 32:05.000
Your Majesty, we're deities
after having attained the Way

32:05.000 --> 32:09.160
We'd never hold the ranking order
the mortals drew up in high regards

32:09.800 --> 32:10.880
Your Majesty...

32:10.880 --> 32:13.400
Enough. I did say
I'd get to the bottom of it

32:14.120 --> 32:16.400
Why should you worry
if you have nothing to hide?

32:17.120 --> 32:19.160
-Ma-gu
-Yes, Your Majesty

32:19.400 --> 32:22.000
Why did you strike the bell?

32:22.000 --> 32:25.400
Your Majesty, it's been ages
since the bell was struck

32:25.400 --> 32:28.400
I wanted to find out
if the bell was still functional

32:28.400 --> 32:31.160
-Merely to find out?
-Yes

32:31.400 --> 32:33.120
That is the Celestial Court's
alarm bell

32:33.120 --> 32:37.160
If it breaks down when there is
an emergency, I'm afraid...

32:37.800 --> 32:41.400
Afraid of what? That was obviously
your show of mischief

32:41.400 --> 32:45.000
When you saw Prosperity and Er-lang
engaging in a combat,

32:45.000 --> 32:47.400
you tried to create confusion,
didn't you?

32:48.160 --> 32:49.160
I did

32:49.160 --> 32:52.400
Do you know what I've in mind
of striking right now?

32:53.120 --> 32:55.120
-Yes?
-Your skull!

32:55.400 --> 32:57.400
You're getting from bad to worse

32:58.120 --> 33:01.800
You're to clean the celestial stable
for 10 days as punishment!

33:07.400 --> 33:09.400
This temple is very smart!

33:10.880 --> 33:14.400
You get what you've asked for.
It answers your prayers!

33:14.400 --> 33:16.400
You get what you've asked for!

33:20.400 --> 33:22.400
You get what you've asked for?

33:23.000 --> 33:28.400
Let me see how the three of you
will do that!

33:38.400 --> 33:39.400
Who is that?

33:48.000 --> 33:49.400
Let us get out!

33:50.000 --> 33:51.120
Who are you?

33:53.400 --> 33:54.400
Who are you?!

34:41.400 --> 34:46.400
Do you know who I am? I am
the three stars' emissary

34:46.400 --> 34:50.400
You'll be blessed with fortune
if you do my bidding

34:50.400 --> 34:55.400
You'll come across Three Star Temple
if you move westwards from here

34:56.120 --> 35:02.800
Offer prayers in total obeisance
and you'll get what you've asked for

35:05.400 --> 35:07.400
Three Star Temple!

35:13.120 --> 35:16.400
They don't seem familiar
and they look furious!

35:16.400 --> 35:19.400
We'll kill as many of them
as we can

35:21.160 --> 35:25.400
They may look unfriendly
but we shouldn't resort to violence

35:25.400 --> 35:29.000
What I mean is
just give them what they ask for

35:29.000 --> 35:32.000
The issue is whether
we have the ability to do so

35:36.400 --> 35:38.160
Just my luck
to have bumped into them

35:38.160 --> 35:40.400
I get punished every time
there is trouble

35:40.400 --> 35:44.000
I swear I will leave you alone
from now on!

35:58.000 --> 36:00.400
Hey beast,
how did you manage to come here?

36:04.800 --> 36:08.400
I'm not a beast. I'm a smart monkey.
You're a beast, rather!

36:08.400 --> 36:11.400
Cut that crap!
What's that on your head?

36:14.000 --> 36:17.000
To think you could steal
the emperor's head piece

36:17.000 --> 36:18.800
Give it back to me!

36:34.160 --> 36:37.400
To think you could steal
the emperor's head piece

36:37.400 --> 36:39.000
Give it back to me!

36:39.000 --> 36:41.000
-You'll be punished for that
-Nope

36:41.000 --> 36:44.120
Come and get me
if you have what it takes!

37:00.400 --> 37:02.400
Oh my, I'm doomed!

37:03.400 --> 37:07.400
Oh, gosh! To think
you could still be playing chess!

37:07.400 --> 37:09.400
Ma-gu, have you simmered down?

37:09.400 --> 37:12.400
Or you wouldn't have come here.
Let's have tea

37:13.120 --> 37:15.400
Don't you know
there is a looming disaster?

37:16.120 --> 37:18.400
Don't tell me God of Plague
is wreaking havoc again?

37:18.400 --> 37:19.600
You're the plague!

37:19.600 --> 37:22.400
The monkey you created is turning
the Heavenly Palace upside down!

37:22.400 --> 37:26.400
He stole the Emperor's head piece and
even barged into the celestial stable

37:26.400 --> 37:29.400
-And?
-He released all the horses

37:29.400 --> 37:33.120
He stole the Emperor's head piece
and released all the horses!

37:33.120 --> 37:36.160
I bet the Jade Emperor will come down
very hard on us!

37:36.400 --> 37:40.400
The deities' inspection tour will be
affected if the horses aren't available

37:40.400 --> 37:44.120
I'm sure we'll be held
accountable ultimately

37:44.400 --> 37:48.000
We must find the horses before
the inspector tour kicks off

37:48.000 --> 37:49.400
What about the head piece?

37:50.800 --> 37:53.400
We'll split up to find
the horses and the monkey

37:53.400 --> 37:57.160
I guess the head piece
must still be on his head

37:57.160 --> 37:59.400
Yes, it's still on the monkey's head

38:07.120 --> 38:09.000
It's you, Deity of Medicine

38:09.400 --> 38:12.120
What feed did you give to the monkey?

38:12.400 --> 38:16.000
We came to this piece of land
chasing after that crafty monkey

38:16.000 --> 38:17.160
I beg your forgiveness

38:17.160 --> 38:22.400
Why must you fight with me
over the things I want?

38:23.120 --> 38:26.400
It boils down to the different
philosophies we both uphold

38:27.120 --> 38:30.400
-I'd advise you to leave this place
-Not so easy

38:30.400 --> 38:34.400
This monkey has stolen the Emperor's
head piece and freed celestial horses

38:34.400 --> 38:37.400
We must bring him back with us
for the Jade Emperor to punish him

38:40.400 --> 38:45.000
You can have the head piece.
Your mission is accomplished

38:45.000 --> 38:46.400
What about the monkey?

38:46.400 --> 38:51.400
This monkey is intelligent. I'd like
to train him to help me find herbs

38:51.400 --> 38:55.400
-So he will stay
-Who are you to decide on that?

38:55.400 --> 38:57.400
That monkey has committed
a heinous crime

38:57.400 --> 38:59.400
We have to present him
to the Jade Emperor

38:59.400 --> 39:03.400
Let me remind you that
this place is under my charge

39:03.400 --> 39:07.120
I'm prepared to let you get away
with trespassing this forbidden zone

39:07.120 --> 39:09.400
Please do not cross the line

39:09.400 --> 39:11.400
How can you be so arbitrary?

39:11.400 --> 39:14.400
How can we face the Jade Emperor
without the monkey with us?

39:14.400 --> 39:18.160
That's your problem.
It has nothing to do with me

39:18.160 --> 39:20.400
We won't waste time arguing with him

39:20.400 --> 39:23.400
Are you letting us have the monkey?

39:23.400 --> 39:26.800
Try taming my boy first!

39:28.400 --> 39:29.800
Your boy?

39:30.800 --> 39:32.800
Please hold these for me

39:34.120 --> 39:38.120
I can easily tame this boy
with my bare hands

40:05.800 --> 40:07.400
Hey! Careful!

40:48.000 --> 40:51.120
I will get back to you
to settle this score!

40:55.160 --> 40:58.120
Enemies are never too few.
Why must you have another one?

40:58.120 --> 41:01.800
He forced me into it.
It's a waste of my time

41:01.800 --> 41:03.400
Let me catch that monkey first

41:04.000 --> 41:07.000
You'll suffer from
that temperament of yours!

41:07.000 --> 41:08.800
How come you're back here?

41:08.800 --> 41:12.120
Have you been granting happiness
to people at will?

41:12.800 --> 41:15.400
We have no power to grant people
happiness at will

41:15.400 --> 41:20.000
We'll let those who come here
to have what they've asked for

41:20.000 --> 41:23.000
The three masters said so.
We remembered that

41:24.000 --> 41:27.400
You mean you let those who come here
to have what they've asked for?

41:28.000 --> 41:30.400
-That's right
-We're done for!

41:30.400 --> 41:33.000
This is a major blunder...

41:33.000 --> 41:34.400
You can't be more stupid!

41:35.120 --> 41:39.120
Try to recall if this place has been
visited upon by strange characters

41:40.000 --> 41:43.160
Almost all these worshippers
are strange characters

41:43.160 --> 41:46.400
I'm talking about
those who are very special

41:48.400 --> 41:53.000
Two days ago, the prisoners
from the nearby prison...

41:54.400 --> 41:56.000
Prisoners?

42:05.400 --> 42:09.120
Do you think those who do good turns
are always right?

42:09.120 --> 42:13.400
That monkey was only another beast
in the mortal world

42:14.120 --> 42:16.120
Yet you brought him
to the Celestial Court

42:16.400 --> 42:20.000
Yet you have no answer
to the havoc he's created!

42:20.400 --> 42:28.400
Your Majesty, we'll be answerable
for the head-piece incident

42:28.400 --> 42:31.000
A mere head piece doesn't add up
to anything

42:31.400 --> 42:35.400
What's serious is all that you did
in the mortal world

42:35.400 --> 42:40.000
You simply granted pardon
to the escaped prisoners

42:40.000 --> 42:42.400
You saved the life
of a notorious bandit

42:42.400 --> 42:46.120
But you let him carry on
indulging in killings

42:46.400 --> 42:52.160
You might have saved a life
but he put down a few lives in return

42:52.400 --> 42:56.000
Tell me if you've done a good turn
or helped in condoning evil!

42:56.000 --> 42:59.400
Your Majesty, God of Plague
was behind all this

42:59.400 --> 43:03.400
You did expose God of Plague
for hatching an evil plot

43:03.400 --> 43:09.000
You had a fierce battle with him
but failed to have him captured

43:09.000 --> 43:14.120
The mortals were taken hostage instead.
Do you think you've done a good turn?

43:14.400 --> 43:18.160
Indeed. Er...

43:18.160 --> 43:19.400
Not a good turn, really

43:19.400 --> 43:24.000
Your Majesty, Fortune offered people
any number of children at Ping An

43:24.000 --> 43:26.120
Longevity was too generous
in granting longevity

43:26.120 --> 43:29.400
Prosperity was too liberal
in granting titles and positions

43:29.400 --> 43:32.000
The damage has been done

43:32.400 --> 43:34.120
There is a sudden increase
in the population,

43:34.120 --> 43:38.400
a shortage of food and an imbalance
between the males and females

43:38.400 --> 43:43.000
The number of unmarried souls
increases in leaps and bounds...

43:43.000 --> 43:45.160
which in turn leads to
moral degradation

43:45.160 --> 43:48.160
Your Majesty,
that's nothing in comparison

43:48.160 --> 43:50.400
Speak up, God of Kitchen

43:50.400 --> 43:54.400
What the trio did was to disrupt
the natural course of events

43:55.120 --> 43:57.400
It would only result in upsetting
the law of nature

43:57.400 --> 44:04.120
I believe fortune and longevity
come with hard work and great effort

44:04.120 --> 44:07.400
They're not to be granted
at someone's whim and fancy

44:08.160 --> 44:11.160
Well said - my sentiments too

44:12.400 --> 44:14.800
You've faltered on matters of principle

44:15.400 --> 44:20.000
The trio have failed on matters
of discipline and charity

44:20.000 --> 44:25.000
I can tolerate no more pardon.
You will be severely punished

44:25.400 --> 44:28.000
I want you to have it
etched in your memory!

44:28.400 --> 44:32.400
But the trio did a miracle
by taming the beast, Nian

44:32.400 --> 44:35.160
They did work hard even though
the result wasn't as credible

44:35.160 --> 44:36.400
Stop speaking up for them

44:36.800 --> 44:40.000
A credit is a credit, a flaw a flaw.
They're not to be put on a par

44:40.400 --> 44:44.000
Owing to the number of times
the trio have ignored celestial rules...

44:44.000 --> 44:46.120
and granted kindnesses
to the mortals unjustifiably,

44:46.120 --> 44:49.120
I hereby declare that
their powers will be nullified

44:49.120 --> 44:52.400
You'll be relieved of all your positions
and relegated to being mortals!

44:53.400 --> 44:54.480
Subtitles: H Yap
